     "source": "II. Use of English\n                          Maximum score – 20 points / Time – 30 minutes\n\n     Task 1. Read the text below and complete the sentences by changing the form of the\nword in brackets.\n\n       In many countries, shopping has become an (1) ______ (integrate) part of daily life. People\nspend a lot of time buying (2) ______ (vary) products, from food to clothing to electronics. Over\nthe years, shopping has become more (3) ______ (convenience) with the rise of online stores,\nallowing people to shop without leaving their homes.\n       Some people find shopping very (4) _____ (relax), especially when they are looking for\nclothes or new gadgets. On the other hand, others find it stressful, especially when they have to\nmake decisions quickly. Shopping can be an (5) _____ (enjoy) experience, but it can also be (6)\n______ (exhaust), especially when you have a long list of things to buy.\n       It’s important to be careful when shopping, especially when it comes to spending money.\nIt’s easy to get caught up in the (7) ______ (excite) of sales and discounts, but being mindful of\nyour budget is important to avoid (8) ______ (necessity) expenses.\n       Additionally, shopping is often a social activity. Many people go shopping with family or\nfriends to enjoy the experience together. It can be a (9) _____ (pleasure) way to spend time and\nfind new products, but it’s important to remember that shopping should be done (10) ______\n(responsible).\n\nTask 2. Complete each sentence with the correct tense form of the verb.\n\n11 If I had a car, I _____ (drive) it carefully.\n12 I ______ (read) this book since morning.\n13 Who _____ (take) care of your pets when you aren’t at home?\n14 We _____ (meet) our friends at the cinema tonight.\n15 I think I _____ (have) some salad for dinner.\n16 A new museum _____ (open) in the city centre next month.\n17 How long _____ (wait) you for me?\n18 We _____ (watch) TV the whole evening yesterday.\n19 If only I _____ (have) time to go to the cinema.\n20 This bridge _____ (repair) from 5 pm to 7 pm yesterday.",
