     "source": "II. Use of English\n                          Maximum score – 20 points / Time – 30 minutes\n\nTask 1. Each number (on the right side) indicates a line with one grammar mistake. Find\nthe mistake.\nEx.: 0 – go\n\n      Last summer, my classmates and I go on a camping trip to Pine Forest. We had            0\nbeen planning it for weeks, and everyone was looking forward to spend time in nature.         1\nWe packed our bags early in the morning and left the city on sunrise. When we reached         2\nthe forest, the air was cool and fresh, and a sun appeared. We had never felt such free       3\nand full of energy.                                                                           4\n      We set up our tents among two tall trees, not too far from a clear stream. It was the   5\nperfect spot. In night, we sat around the fire and told stories. We roasted marshmallows,     6\ntold ghost stories, and listened to the sounds of the forest. We could heard owls hooting     7\nand leaves rustling in the wind, but we didn’t afraid. We knew we should stay close to        8\nthe campsite.\n      Although it rained a few, we still had fun. There was nothing that could spoil our      9\nadventure. Everyone learned something useful. We supported each other and laughed\neven when things didn’t go as planned. On the way home, everyone were tired but               10\nhappy.\n\nTask 2. Complete the sentences 11-15 so that they have a similar meaning to the original.\n\n11 Saule doesn’t go to the cinema. And Arman doesn’t go to the cinema.\nNeither ____________________ .\n12 My best friend lives far away.\nI wish he __________________ .\n13 The last time I was abroad was in 2022.\nI haven’t __________________ .\n14 When did they start to work in that university?\nHow long ______________________ ?\n15 Did William Shakespeare write Romeo and Juliet?\nWas ____________________ ?\n\nTask 3. Choose the correct variant.\n\n16 There was _____ to eat and drink in the fridge.\na. many                  b. a lot                 c. lots of                d. lot of\n17 Parents want their children _____ .\na. be healthy and        b. healthy and happy     c. being healthy and      d. to be healthy and\nhappy                                             happy                     happy\n18 Are you angry _____ me?\na. on                    b. by                    c. with                   d. because\n19 My friend has given me _____ .\na. such a good advice b. so good advice           c. such good advice       d. such good advices\n20 Arman does _____ but play online games all day.\n\n\na. something            b. anything             c. nothing               d. everything",
