     "source": "III. Writing\n                      Maximum score – 40 points / Time - 45 minutes\n\nChoose ONE of the given topics below. Write between 120-130 words in an appropriate\nstyle on your answer sheet. Pay attention to grammar accuracy, spelling, layout (structure),\nlinking words / time expressions.\n\n1 Write a blog entry on the topic “Smart Shopping Tips for Teenagers”\n2 Write a blog entry on the topic “What I Learned from Visiting a New Country or City”\n3 Write an opinion essay on the topic “Zoos are a good way to protect animals. Do you agree or\ndisagree?”\n4 Write an opinion essay on the topic “Travelling is the best way to learn about the world. Do\nyou agree?”\n5 Write an article on the topic “Some Ways to Reduce Plastic Use in Daily Life”\n6 Write an article on the topic “Some Tips How I Organise My Week”\n7 Write a for-and-against essay on the topic “Is cooking at home better than eating out?”\n8 Write a for-and-against essay on the topic “Are video games a good way to relax?”",
